# Shark Typhoon: Cycling {X}{1}{U} with X = 2 costs exactly four mana (the pool is empty right after paying), and "when you
# cycle this card" makes a 2/2 blue Shark with flying (X is the cycling cost's, CR 107.3a, 702.29c) from the graveyard the
# Typhoon was cycled into. The trigger goes on the stack above the cycling ability (the fifth Mox under both) and resolves
# before the draw (CR 603.3, 405.5): the Shark is there while the hand is still the one Island, and the draw comes after.

